        {
            "title": "Big Engine-Changes!",
            "date": "2021-02-08 14:48:25",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4051520458184586275",
            "content": "Heyho everyone!\n\nIt has been several years (and a crazy Anniversary Edition), that we have released Edna & Harvey: The Breakout. A lot has changed since then - and to keep up with the times, we put our minds together to bring you Edna on Unity!\n\nWhat does that mean? Well, foremost, no nasty java-crashes anymore!\n\nBut in general, all players will find a select option when booting up the game. Clicking the first selection will start the game in it's Unity Version - the second one is the old Java Version.\n\nNow all new savegames on the Unity Version are compatible with the Anniversary Edition of Edna & Harvey: The Breakout.\n\nYou can find a selection of savegames on our [url=https://www.daedalicsupport.com/en/games/the-breakout/savegames.html?open=collapse124-4]support site[/url]!\n\nAdditionally we have added French, Russian and Chinese Simplified/Traditional to the new Unity Version!\n\nEnjoy!\nDaedalic Entertainment"
        },
        {
