        {
            "title": "If you have technical issues",
            "date": "2013-11-14 09:32:27",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1027114127638725665",
            "content": "Please note that we cannot offer official technical support on this board, except for posting the latest patch notes.\r\n\r\n[h1]But your games and my computer don’t work as a team! Where can I get help?[/h1]\r\nWe do offer technical support. Just not in forums. Please contact our colleagues from the support via mail using [url=mailto:support@daedalic.de] support@daedalic.de[/url]. However, feel free and use this forum (or our [url=http://forum.daedalic.de/index.php]official forum[/url]) to address your technical problem. We are certain that many players of our games are able to help you out with certain problems.  \r\n\r\n[h1]What can I do to speed up the support process?[/h1]\r\nIn order to speed up the process our support needs information of your running system and the game (version) you are playing. So [url=http://forum.daedalic.de/viewtopic.php?f=145&t=1530]please read before reporting technical issues to us[/url].\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your ongoing support!\r\n\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nyour Daedalic Entertainment Community Team\r\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "If you have technical issues",
            "date": "2013-11-14 09:32:27",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3819571572130774628",
            "content": "Please note that we cannot offer official technical support on this board, except for posting the latest patch notes.\r\n\r\n[h1]But your games and my computer don’t work as a team! Where can I get help?[/h1]\r\nWe do offer technical support. Just not in forums. Please contact our colleagues from the support via mail using [url=mailto:support@daedalic.de] support@daedalic.de[/url]. However, feel free and use this forum (or our [url=http://forum.daedalic.de/index.php]official forum[/url]) to address your technical problem. We are certain that many players of our games are able to help you out with certain problems.  \r\n\r\n[h1]What can I do to speed up the support process?[/h1]\r\nIn order to speed up the process our support needs information of your running system and the game (version) you are playing. So [url=http://forum.daedalic.de/viewtopic.php?f=145&t=1530]please read before reporting technical issues to us[/url].\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your ongoing support!\r\n\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nyour Daedalic Entertainment Community Team\r\n"
